text = "Darren, I know Titania is going to kill you one day through your sheer incompetence. I wrote this note specifically for you to not get yourself killed. 

1. Before even going into the room, bring a gas mask so you don't breathe in the phosphine gas (P.S. if you can't find one, please don't try and hold your breath)

2. If you ever need to open Titania's cage, make sure to keep a flashlight on you. The thing is scared of light when theres gas in the area

3. The room will enter lockdown the moment you open that cage, and it will not stop until you get Titania back into the cage. Just shine your flashlight at it and make sure to assert your dominance while you do it."
scroll_active = false
autowrap_mode = 2

